   169	**Built now** (common to every option the author may choose):
   170	- attempt isolation and immutable attempt material;
   171	- the single lifecycle writer, the fence and version-guarded writes;
   172	- the latch with its preserved presentation;
   173	- expiry and discard on complete negative evidence;
   174	- atomic end-and-allocate, and the atomic final refusal when N attempts end by permitted paths;
   175	- the storage-lifetime fix;
   176	- the public view.
   177	
   178	Failure history (`unavailable_since`, `failed_intervals`) is recorded for diagnosis.
   179	
   180	**Gated off** until a signed amendment decides step 5:
   181	- committing `EVIDENCE_UNAVAILABLE` from sampled failure;
