   142	   a conjunct.
   143	7. **After the latch.** The preserved qualifying presentation is used for assembly; it is never swapped for a
   144	   different, worse one. A transient failure (store, explorer, calendar, DNS snapshot) is retried. The attempt is
   145	   discarded only for a failure the frozen attempt cannot cure even with recovered evidence: T of the preserved
   146	   presentation > not-after (A9 `:422`), or a verifier reason that depends only on the attempt's committed bytes.
