   157	   open, unlatched attempt its B, with a note that the twelve days are nominal. The 15-minute visibility tolerance
   158	   applies as stated; it never moves B.
   159	10. **Mechanized check before code** (revision 4 adds the cases from ILC2: observation-to-send delay, a commit
   160	    delayed after the send, a crash before persistence, timely burial with no observation, partial header recovery,
